":"2026-11-22T17:08:36.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T17:08:36.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2108003897029687176","title":"请问她的名字叫什么?","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/330939888/answer/2108003897029687176","description":"啧…一个转进内娱的网红，叫 章若楠。 章若楠_百度百科 [图片] [图片] [文章: 章若楠壁纸|章若楠壁纸图|章若楠美图]","image":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-14f5fabb174938371f06df9e67d964a5_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T17:08:13.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T17:08:13.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2108003748605961822","title":"想知道这张图是情头吗?","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/405624606/answer/2108003748605961822","description":"啧…乱答个毛啊。 [图片] 这青山刚昌的货，1999年出的，柯南火了以后那边顺手把青山的早期短篇作品拿来动画化了。 女的那个是另外一集的，这俩根本就不是同一个故事。 [图片]","image":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c28b061ce93b1b01a2bb523332e446d4_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T17:07:38.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T17:07:38.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2108003488810660984","title":"问一下，这是哪个明星？","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/326392417/answer/2108003488810660984","description":"啧…Louis William Tomlinson，英国流行乐男歌手，男子组合单向组合（One Direction）队长。 路易斯·汤姆林森_百度百科 [图片] 喜欢小众的偶像是一种怎样的体验？","image":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-db4b4cabfaf820cdf1da0bf9cfd3e415_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T17:06:36.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T17:06:36.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2107989774179029467","title":"大家帮我看看这是哪个动漫人物吧！！！？","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/401601454/answer/2107989774179029467","description":"啧…彩加个锤子，乱答个毛啊。 这画师 たか（PID405145） 作品。 [图片] 人物是《偶像大师灰姑娘》安娜史塔西亚，因为有毛子血统，不出意外的是找政委配的音。 原图： [图片] 顺便这画师账号申请比较早，PID才6位数，从2009年就开始画了，笔耕不辍，当年还是既画美少女又画抽象图的，现在清一色抽象图。","image":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2931c18d7b5a954eaf960d60b9643dd3_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T16:12:06.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T16:12:06.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2107989532553523362","title":"请问一下这个演员是谁啊？。。?","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/531786982/answer/2107989532553523362","description":"啧…尚语贤，唐探里演蓝毛黑客那个。 尚语贤_百度百科 [图片] [图片] #sohufashi... - @搜狐时尚的微博 - 微博","image":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fac88f7a4c181409ca811fe3cd64b03d_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T16:11:09.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T16:11:09.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2107989412583954107","title":"还有这种风格的头像吗?","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/465603643/answer/2107989412583954107","description":"啧…这个是南朝鲜画师 mannerer62 作品。 [图片] [图片] 插画集~ by.ma... - @大神手绘作品的微博 - 微博","image":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a4bc4727e7c148efa031650215e1d8ff_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T16:10:40.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T16:10:40.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2107989278374498667","title":"想问下这个头像是不是情头？","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/379696351/answer/2107989278374498667","description":"啧…可以开除二籍了。 不过其他问情头的题甩上来的图乱七八糟五花八门，但这题这一幕偏偏还真就是这两口子初见。 [图片] [图片] 要图自己去截去。","image":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-544c810c53033327d8d1d5f38123bd12_qhd.jpg?source=c8b7c179","author":{"name":"工叔","uri":"http://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/people/e40c4495e66937d3e085ff1b5f2d03a6"},"published":"2026-11-22T16:10:08.000Z","updated":"2026-11-22T16:10:08.000Z"},{"id":"zhihu:answer:2107642757376484880","title":"这个女孩是什么人啊？","link":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/407645549/answer/2107642757376484880","description":"啧…这是个coser，叫 Tsuki Desu。 [图片] 【COS鉴赏】[Tsuki Desu]Saber Maid_哔哩哔哩_bilibili 这妞cos生化Re4懂事梨挺还原的。 [图片] 这cos的是碧蓝航线的 绫波。 [图片] 这人的图没满18岁别去找了（ins没满16岁别去看了），当然你这个战斗力我告诉你你也找不到就是。","image":"